    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a3991cf2334b51301bda1bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵锵☆\r\n任务完成了！\r\n不愧是，我的训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8247f62bd61186deb234f788d47ed3a1597e00f0997e717ecb08306c9464979",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f2909681d9505ba1ce7fb6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要举办活动！\r\n好，不管什么都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2e518a7112e31ba3199dcc44e3958892cef489aeb2318b511abb032da17e9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3244f203ee7673047107aecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动，好像已经开始\r\n了哦！光看着不会有任何\r\n收获，先参加再说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c406a236bb2ebc56046f3e8cf25c668b7b3642b24b802a3fab2bb5ee5a7944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e39b870593e92d9d341492cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次不会输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce45e4f286ed694431c73a6bab6421bb6d18586fd7e3368a9ce4476935378ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c122cd18e15cc2aa1ffa39e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升！\r\n训练员也在贯彻\r\n最强呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad10ea003eeb9cef69d7cf2201f77d858cca88da04e81aeb63c13901e2a4585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8e21916ed4a5f464aeef230",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看，胸前的标志！\r\n没错，是英里☆\r\n为了找到它可费了不少劲～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f4e59b5947e754c8e7c6b5814c7442520ca4a75542b1ac39b4f122f5dbac51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66ccf45fd9fb0bba81515cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从小就很擅长，保持衣服干净！\r\n就算玩躲避球之类的，\r\n也从没被击中过就赢了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9788b82cc78de9c7764b6113a79fcaac517b32da287ae521d38426c0d74bcdea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edda7c77d357e0926548daf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "购物时重要的是能不能\r\n积攒里程！所以，事先\r\n收集信息可是必不可少的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db19d10cef1708aa7918e34fabaa41368f63a91dbdba0310f67e03356fc9678a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e282dbd96746783226f83589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都很强呢，双方都是。",
